# Neither of these is required for a local checkout, and neither is secret.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in only what you need to override.

# The Convex deployment this panel talks to.
#
# LEAVE IT UNSET LOCALLY. `npx convex dev` writes CONVEX_URL into the
# REPOSITORY ROOT .env.local, and vite.config.ts finds it there. Set this only
# in a deployment, or to point a local build at a different deployment.
# VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment.convex.cloud

# The marketing site's origin, for the "sluice" wordmark in the header and nav.
# Defaults to http://localhost:3000, which is where `next dev` serves apps/web.
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://sluice.dev
